  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F. Grease a 9x13 in baking dish.",
    "Put the sweet potatoes in a pot of boiling water and simmer until fork tender, about 15 minutes. Drain.",
    "In a large bowl (or the cooking pot), mash the sweet potatoes with the brown sugar, butter, cinnamon, vanilla, salt, and pepper.",
    "Fold in half of the pecans and spread the mixture in the prepared dish.",
    "Sprinkle with the marshmallows and the remaining pecans.",
    "Bake 25 minutes, until the marshmallows are golden brown and the casserole is heated through."
